+# Source control
+
+On 8 Nov 2026, https://github.com/ourhumancondition/nomad was a public repository with `size: 0`, `default_branch: main`, no file listing (contents API 404), and no commits (commits API 409). There was no history to overwrite.
+
+This cloud run’s git remote is the private Origin draft it was started with. `gh auth status` reported no GitHub login. `git credential fill` for `https://github.com` failed because no username was available. The draft was not pushed to GitHub, was not force-pushed, and was not mirrored.
+
+To continue in the GitHub repository, push this work with a credential that has write access to `ourhumancondition/nomad`, without `--force`. The repository is public, so it must keep containing only the app, the fictional example, and documentation. Real travel rows, mailbox contents, passport details, and booking references do not belong in it.
+
+The methods wiki repository returned 404 and was not modified.
